# a hand on a pitch knob, to listen to (sweep.wav): drone I alone (drone II's level at 0 on the Shape page),
# its filter fairly open. A slow full turn of KNOB 1 (20 detents, 150 ms apart: an octave in 3 s), back
# down at a medium speed, a quick spin up, then fine tuning with SEL held. Every part should sound like
# a continuous slide, never steps.
# Pitch lock off (on at start since 2026-10-19): these move the pitch
set 74 0
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
spin K4 -100
tap HOME
spin K2 20
wav sweep.wav
tap PLAY
wait 1500
turn K1 20 150
wait 600
expect par0 6200
turn K1 -20 50
wait 600
expect par0 >4800
expect par0 <5000
turn K1 15 15
wait 600
press SEL
turn K1 -20 100
release SEL
wait 800
tap PLAY
wait 1200
wavstop
